cff-version: 1.2.0
title: OpenCritique Commons
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
  Do not cite this package as evidence of reviewer precision, recall, or
  comparative scientific performance.
type: software
authors:
  - name: OpenCritique Commons contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/fraware/OpenCritique-Commons
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.6.0a0
abstract: >-
  Open, system-neutral infrastructure for representing, adjudicating, and
  evaluating scientific concerns. Engineering release 0.6.0a0; schema freeze
  identity remains 0.5.0a1. Scientific performance claims remain unauthorized
  until rights-cleared natural cases and independent adjudication gates are met.
keywords:
  - scientific critique
  - adjudication
  - evaluation infrastructure
  - open science
